SHAPE:  a cave with a stream and a raft
DEPTH:  2
WEIGHT: 3
MOOD:   Dark water runs across the cave. A raft is tied up at your side; a chest stands on the far bank.
THING:  W = raft do:raft
MAP
 ...c...
 .......
 ~~~~~~~
 ~~~~~~~
 ~~~~~~~
 ~~~W~~~
 .......
    +
ENDMAP

