SHAPE:  a passage with a vent of wind
DEPTH:  2
WEIGHT: 3
MOOD:   A gale roars down the passage out of a vent in the far wall. A block of stone stands in the way.
THING:  V = wind vent do:vent
THING:  B = stone block do:block
THING:  R = lever do:lever
EVENT:  when=bump at=R then=reset again=yes
MAP
    V
    .
    .c
    .
    .
    .
    B
 R......
 .......
    +
ENDMAP

NAME:   shifting maze
SHAPE:  a hall of walls that move
DEPTH:  2
WEIGHT: 3
MOOD:   The walls in this hall stand in grooves. Every few heartbeats they grind a step.
THING:  S = shifting wall do:shift
THING:  G = shifting wall, drawn back do:shift
MAP
 ...c...
 .......
 SGSGSGS
 .......
 GSGSGSG
 .......
    +
ENDMAP

