NAME:   rune walk
SHAPE:  a hall of runes in the floor
DEPTH:  2
WEIGHT: 3
MOOD:   Four runes are cut in the floor, one behind the other. Over the arch is cut: the third from the door, then the first, then the farthest, then the second.
