THING:  B = rune tile do:rune
THING:  C = rune tile do:rune
THING:  D = rune tile do:rune
THING:  Q = bars
EVENT:  when=order:CADB then=open:Q then=msg:"The four runes blaze together. The bars sink away."
MAP
   c
   Q
 .....
 ..D..
 .....
 ..C..
 .....
 ..B..
 .....
 ..A..
 .....
   +
ENDMAP

