NAME:   storm rod
SHAPE:  a room with an iron rod and a nook
DEPTH:  2
WEIGHT: 3
MOOD:   An iron rod stands out of the floor, wired into the wall by the bars. Down a narrow way choked with old webs, a lever.
THING:  T = iron rod do:rod
THING:  Q = bars
THING:  L = lever do:lever
THING:  X = web do:burnable
EVENT:  when=charged at=T then=open:Q
EVENT:  when=bump at=L then=open:Q
MAP
    c
    Q
 .......
 ...T...
+.......
 .......
 .####X#
      L
ENDMAP

NAME:   twin plates
SHAPE:  a hall with two plates far apart
DEPTH:  1
WEIGHT: 3
MOOD:   Two plates lie far apart in the floor. One pair of feet will not do; you need two, or a heavy friend.
THING:  P = pressure plate do:pressure
THING:  Q = bars
COUNTER: plates 0
EVENT:  when=press at=P then=add:plates again=yes
EVENT:  when=release at=P then=sub:plates again=yes
EVENT:  when=count:plates:2 then=open:Q
MAP
        c
        Q
 ...............
 .P...........P.
 ...............
        +
ENDMAP

NAME:   guard hall
SHAPE:  a hall with guards, a gong and a keyhole
DEPTH:  2
WEIGHT: 3
MOOD:   Guards doze in this hall. A gong hangs in a side nook; a keyhole is set beside a barred alcove.
THING:  G = gong do:lure
THING:  K = keyhole do:guarded
THING:  Q = bars
EVENT:  when=unlock at=K then=open:Q
CREATURE: ? at 3,4
CREATURE: ? at 9,4
MAP
       c
  K    Q
 ...........
 ...........
 ...........
 ...........
 G..........
       +
ENDMAP

NAME:   timed gate
SHAPE:  a long hall with a plate and a far gate
DEPTH:  2
WEIGHT: 3
MOOD:   A plate in the floor at one end, a barred alcove far off at the other. Whatever opens it will not wait long.
THING:  P = pressure plate do:pressure
THING:  Q = bars
EVENT:  when=press at=P then=open:Q then=after:14:shut:Q again=yes
MAP
 c
 Q
 ..............
 ..............
 ............P.
 ..............
       +
ENDMAP

NAME:   moon chapel
SHAPE:  a chapel with a shaft to the sky
DEPTH:  2
WEIGHT: 3
MOOD:   A narrow shaft runs up through the stone to the sky. A silver mirror stands below it, and a disc waits.
MOOD:   An old chapel of the moon. By day it is only grey.
THING:  S = shaft of moonlight do:moonshaft
THING:  M = mirror on a swivel do:swivel
THING:  D = sun disc do:sundisc
THING:  Q = bars
EVENT:  when=moon at=D then=open:Q then=msg:"The disc shines white. The bars slide away."
MAP
   S    c
 .......Q.
 .........
 ..M....D.
 .........
 .........
     +
ENDMAP
